    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flight Runner Universe</strong> is a chaotic multiplayer arena game blending aerial combat, vehicular mayhem, and wild game modes into one explosive experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In <strong>Battle Royale</strong>, take to the skies and clash on a gravity-warped battlefield. With multiple lives and point-based scoring, every elimination brings you closer to ultimate victory. Outmaneuver, outgun, and outlast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Beat-em-up Soccer</strong>, enter the stadium where goals and knockouts both count. Use weapons, vehicles, and flight powers to brawl your way to victory in the most intense match you've ever played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Racing Mode</strong>, blaze through roads and tracks scattered across the map. Blast your way to the finish using flight boosts and tactical shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your mode. Pick your playstyle. <strong>Master the skies and dominate the arena.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flight Runner Universe</strong> is a chaotic multiplayer arena game blending aerial combat, vehicular mayhem, and wild game modes into one explosive experience.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> In <strong>Battle Royale</strong>, take to the skies and clash on a gravity-warped battlefield. With multiple lives and point-based scoring, every elimination brings you closer to ultimate victory. Outmaneuver, outgun, and outlast.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Beat-em-up Soccer</strong>, enter the stadium where goals and knockouts both count. Use weapons, vehicles, and flight powers to brawl your way to victory in the most intense match you've ever played.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Racing Mode</strong>, blaze through roads and tracks scattered across the map. Blast your way to the finish using flight boosts and tactical shortcuts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your mode. Pick your playstyle. <strong>Master the skies and dominate the arena.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Flight Runner Universe is a fast-paced multiplayer game where players fly, race, and brawl in chaotic arenas. Battle in elimination rounds, score wild goals in beat-em-up soccer, or race across the map. Master every mode to dominate the skies!",
